  <name>Pasaporte</name>
  <summary>Graphical openconnect client with GlobalProtect/SAML</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Pasaporte is a Qt/PySide6 GUI for openconnect. It supports Fortinet,
      GlobalProtect with SAML, and the other openconnect protocols.
    </p>
    <p>
      Connections are stored in a JSON file, with migration to
      ~/.config/pasaporte/hosts.json. The interface is available in English
      and Spanish.
    </p>
  </description>
